# Important paths need Owner review (enforced once the ruleset requires code-owner review).
# Replace @OWNER with the repository owner account or team.
#
# The required active pattern set is derived from repo_class and metadata:
# - Universal minimum: /.github/ and /AGENTS.md
# - Metadata callers: /<guide> (e.g. /docs/repository-guide.md)
# - Shared repositories (repo_class=shared): category paths declared in .github/repo-contract.json
#   under cross_repo_contract, gate_review, release_signing, privacy_credentials.
# Product repositories may retain additional patterns that protect important paths.
/.github/                  @OWNER
/AGENTS.md                 @OWNER
/docs/repository-guide.md  @OWNER
